## E3 (L5) — Your first market model

Fit $R_{XLE,t} = a + b\,R_{SPY,t} + e_t$ on the full sample by minimizing
SSE. Report â (daily alpha), b̂ (beta). Then compare against
`statsmodels`:

```python
import statsmodels.api as sm
X = sm.add_constant(r[x_name])
print(sm.OLS(r[y_name], X).fit().params)
```

